[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  \u001b[95m●\u001b[39m \u001b[2mskipped\u001b[22m\r\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[95m◇\u001b[39m  \u001b[1mOne paste left — app/layout.tsx\u001b[22m\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    import { VendoProvider } from \"@vendoai/vendo/react\";\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    import theme from \"../.vendo/theme.json\";\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    import type { VendoTheme } from \"@vendoai/vendo\";\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    … then wrap: <VendoProvider baseUrl=\"/api/vendo\" theme={theme as VendoTheme}>{children}</VendoProvider>\r\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    \u001b[2mdocs.vendo.run/quickstart#the-client-mount — exact wording for layout.tsx and _app.tsx\u001b[22m\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  <VendoProvider> is what the @vendoai/ui hooks and embeds read; baseUrl is the wire mount, path prefix\r\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  included. Until this lands, Vendo is wired but nothing on the page can reach it.\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  Then confirm it landed: npx vendo doctor\r\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  \u001b[2minit never edits your files\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  Verify everything: \u001b[1m\u001b[95mnpx vendo doctor\u001b[39m\u001b[22m (it can start the server and run a live turn).\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\r\n"]
